@page "/verified"

<PageTitle>Verified Portal · Juris</PageTitle>

<section class="j-hero">
    <div class="j-container">
        <div class="j-eyebrow">For Firms · Verified Portal</div>
        <h1>Own your profile. See your students.</h1>
        <p class="j-lede">
            Verified firms claim editorial control of their Juris profile, edit their salary &amp; perks data,
            and access the HR Dashboard — anonymized analytics on which schools are reading,
            which perks they are clicking, and where they are dropping off.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="mailto:partners@juris.local?subject=Juris%20Verified%20Access%20Request" class="j-button j-primary j-large j-plain">Request access →</a>
            <a href="/Account/Login" class="j-button j-large j-plain">Sign in</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="j-section">
    <div class="j-container">
        <div class="j-section-head">
            <div>
                <div class="j-eyebrow">What you get</div>
                <h2>Three things every HR team has been asking for.</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="j-stat-grid">
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">Editorial Control</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">Profile claim &amp; edit</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Update salary bands, perks, billable target, AI policy, and culture copy directly from the portal. Changes go live on the public profile within minutes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">The Student Funnel</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">Profile views · CTR · dwell</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Total profile views, time-on-section between Hard Data and Vibe, and click-through rate on the Apply button — daily.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">School Demographics</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">Anonymized affiliation</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Which Ontario law schools are most interested in your firm. By 1L / 2L / 3L cohort. Anonymized at the student level; aggregated at the school level.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">The Vibe Heatmap</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">Perk &amp; section clicks</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Which perks (AI training, wellness, hybrid policy) draw the most clicks — and which sections of your profile retain attention.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">Peer Benchmarking</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">vs. your peer group</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">How your engagement compares to your peer set — Seven Sisters, Mid-Law, Boutique, or National Full-Service.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="j-stat-cell">
                <div class="j-stat-label">Drop-off Analysis</div>
                <div class="j-stat-value" style="font-size: 22px;">Recruitment leakage</div>
                <p class="j-mt-4" style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Where students exit your profile — billable target, hireback rate, or compensation. The data conversation no one was having.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="j-section j-grey">
    <div class="j-container">
        <div class="j-section-head">
            <h2>How it works</h2>
        </div>
        <ol style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; counter-reset: step; max-width: 70ch;">
            <li style="border-top: 1px solid var(--juris-fg); padding: 28px 0; counter-increment: step;">
                <div class="j-eyebrow" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--juris-grey-4);">Step 01</div>
                <h3>Email partners@juris.local</h3>
                <p style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6;">Tell us who at the firm should be the verified contact. Include the firm name and the contact's email address. Our editorial team reviews requests within two business days.</p>
            </li>
            <li style="border-top: 1px solid var(--juris-fg); padding: 28px 0; counter-increment: step;">
                <div class="j-eyebrow" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--juris-grey-4);">Step 02</div>
                <h3>Claim &amp; verify</h3>
                <p style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6;">We provision a verified login linked to your firm profile. You set your password on first sign-in. The Verified badge appears on your profile.</p>
            </li>
            <li style="border-top: 1px solid var(--juris-fg); padding: 28px 0; counter-increment: step;">
                <div class="j-eyebrow" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--juris-grey-4);">Step 03</div>
                <h3>Edit &amp; analyze</h3>
                <p style="font-family: var(--juris-serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6;">Edit your firm profile from the portal. Open the HR Dashboard to see live student engagement data. Export weekly reports as your renewal driver.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="j-newsletter">
    <div class="j-container j-text-center">
        <div class="j-eyebrow" style="color:var(--juris-grey-3);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;">Ready to claim your profile?</div>
        <h2 style="color: var(--juris-bg);">Email partners@juris.local</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--juris-grey-3); max-width: 56ch; margin: 16px auto 32px;">
            Or sign in if your firm has already been provisioned.
        </p>
        <a href="/Account/Login" class="j-button j-large j-plain" style="background: var(--juris-bg); color: var(--juris-fg);">Sign in</a>
    </div>
</section>
